  "problem": "Given that $r(t)=\u27e8\\sqrt{t},\\,t-3\u27e9,$ $|r(5)|=$",
  "worked_solution": "Evaluating the function at $t=5,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(5) & =\u27e8\\sqrt{5},\\,5-3\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\sqrt{5},\\,2\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(5)| & =\\sqrt{{(\\sqrt{5})}^{2}+{(2)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5+4} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
